{"text": "One of them came straight toward me, a slight creature about four feet tall, dressed in a purple tunic with a leather belt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was beautiful and graceful, but he was so frail that he looked like a little figure made of fine china. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Showing no sign of fear, he came up and laughed into my eyes, and then several others began to touch me with soft little hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Their voices were soft and sweet, and there was something so childlike about them that my fear soon melted away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, remembering the danger, I quickly unscrewed the small levers that started the machine and put them safely in my pocket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One of them pointed to the sun and asked me by signs whether I had come from it in the thunderstorm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The question surprised me, for it was the kind of question that a five year old child of our time might ask. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they brought chains of beautiful flowers, which they hung around my neck, laughing, until I was almost covered with them.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "o", "w", "a", "r", "d", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "c", "r", "e", "a", "t", "u", "r", "e", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "e", "e", "t", " ", "t", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "d", "r", "e", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "p", "u", "r", "p", "l", "e", " ", "t", "u", "n", "i", "c", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "l", "e", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "b", "e", "l", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "g", "r", "a", "c",